# Supply your own credentials. No API key is bundled with this repository.
# 请接入自己的 API 密钥；仓库不附带密钥。
# Copy to .env only if .env does not exist, then restart the server.
# Never commit or share .env. Keys stay on the server, not in browser code.

# OpenAI: enables live bilingual chat and AI improvement briefs.
# Optional: maps, place search, OSM surroundings and local rules work without it.
# 自由地图、地名搜索、OSM 周边分析及本地规则演示无需任何密钥；地图服务需联网。
# 使用自己账号可调用且兼容 Responses API 的模型。
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-6.1-sol

# Optional legacy Google proxies: Maps Static API, Places API (New), Roads API.
# Not required for the Leaflet map, Photon place search or OSM surroundings.
# Google 仅为可选独立代理；新地图、搜索及周边关系分析无需 Google 密钥。
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Optional public map-service overrides (no API keys required by defaults).
# Surroundings: Overpass first, then real OSM-derived OpenFreeMap vector tiles.
# Cache: 10 minutes by centre/radius. Search: manual submission, at most 1 req/s.
# 地图是近似环境参考，不作为规范合规依据；保留来源、时间及截断警示。
# PHOTON_URL=https://photon.komoot.io/api/
# OVERPASS_API_URL=https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter

# Optional local-server port. The Windows launcher opens port 4173.
# PORT=4173
